    "result": "I implemented `EnableFeature` in `feature.go`, but I could not run the tests. `go test` needs your approval, so the code is untested.\n\n- **Retries:** if the feature is already `on`, the function does not write the file, so a retried deploy changes nothing.\n- **Timeouts:** it writes a temp file in the same directory and renames it over the config. A deploy that times out mid-write leaves either the old file or the new one, never half a file.\n- **Other lines:** every other line stays byte for byte. The function keeps CRLF line endings and the file permissions. If the feature line appears more than once, every copy becomes `on`.\n- **Bad names:** a name that is empty or contains `=` or a newline returns an error.\n\nI also added `feature_test.go`. It covers a missing file, adding a new line, changing `off` to `on`, and CRLF files, and it calls `EnableFeature` twice on each case to check that the second call changes nothing. Run it with `go test ./...`.",
